      <title>✖️ The Hustle Chinese retailers are moving into the space American brands left b</title>
      <link>https://t.me/KissmeBabyFeedTwitter/24412</link>
      <description>&lt;div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"&gt;&lt;tg-emoji emoji-id="5355148941878900494"&gt;&lt;i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29C96.png')"&gt;&lt;b&gt;✖️&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/tg-emoji&gt; &lt;a href="https://x.com/TheHustle/status/2117696511446573243" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);" rel="noopener" target="_blank"&gt;The Hustle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Chinese retailers are moving into the space American brands left behind.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;In January 2026, &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/SimonPropertyGp" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);" rel="noopener" target="_blank"&gt;@SimonPropertyGp&lt;/a&gt; announced it was adding 20+ new &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/POPMARTGlobal" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);" rel="noopener" target="_blank"&gt;@POPMARTGlobal&lt;/a&gt; locations across its properties.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;That's the biggest mall company in America looking for someone to fill the space American brands left behind.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;And Pop Mart isn't alone.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Miniso is targeting 480 US locations by the end of 2026. Mixue is already taking franchise applications. Chinese sportswear giant ANTA is opening in Beverly Hills.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Fast food chain Wallace, with over 20,000 locations in China, just opened its first US store and plans 10 more by the end of the year.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;China's hyper-competitive retail industry created the playbook. American shoppers hungry for cheaper options handed them the moment.&lt;/div&gt;
